# Ch.10 Agent. Tab Tab (within 300 ms) slides the chat in over whatever is on screen.
# MOCK: the "mock" provider answers with canned text, no network. DEVICE ONLY: a real provider (Settings > Agent),
# the Muse provider, and the Sym push-to-talk voice (voicedown/voiceup stand in for the Sym key; the microphone
# and speech-to-text are real hardware). Do not film API keys; the chat history is stored on disk.
goto:Files,wait:600
Tab,wait:120,Tab,wait:1800
text:open the calculator,wait:900,Return,wait:2500
# confirmation card for the action: accept
Return,wait:2000
# switch provider / agent menu
menu,wait:1500,Escape,wait:800
# push-to-talk (DEVICE ONLY for real audio)
voicedown,wait:2000,voiceup,wait:2500
Escape,wait:1200
# Settings > Agent > Connect (QR)
goto:Settings,wait:500
hold:Escape:1100,wait:900
